            {
              "id": "tap_sp_tabs_html",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"tap-tabs\">\n  <div class=\"tap-tabs-nav\"><button class=\"on\">Description</button><button>Specs</button><button>The luthier</button><button>Reviews (142)</button><button>Shipping</button></div>\n  <div class=\"tap-tabs-content\">\n    <div class=\"tap-tab-grid\">\n      <div><h3>Built for the player who wants the real thing.</h3><p>The Sultan Turkish Oud is Yildirim Palabiyik's signature instrument — a walnut bowl with 23 ribs, a spruce face hand-thinned to 1.8mm, and an ebony fingerboard. The bridge is rosewood; the pegs are boxwood. Each instrument takes 14 days from raw wood to final tuning.</p><p>This particular configuration is set up for standard Turkish tuning (FADGCF) and ships with the original Tapadum hard case. We hand-tune and intonate the instrument in our Brisighella atelier before dispatch.</p></div>\n      <ul class=\"tap-spec-list\"><li><span>Bowl</span>23-rib walnut</li><li><span>Face</span>Spruce, 1.8mm</li><li><span>Fingerboard</span>Ebony</li><li><span>Bridge</span>Rosewood</li><li><span>Pegs</span>Boxwood, 11 pegs</li><li><span>Strings</span>D'Addario nylon · 11 strings</li><li><span>Scale</span>584mm</li><li><span>Total length</span>820mm</li><li><span>Weight</span>1.4 kg</li><li><span>Origin</span>Istanbul, Turkey</li></ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<style>\n.tap-tabs-nav{display:flex;gap:4px;border-bottom:1px solid #E8DFC8;margin-bottom:32px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.tap-tabs-nav button{padding:14px 22px;background:transparent;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#8b7f6a;cursor:pointer;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.02em;margin-bottom:-1px}\n.tap-tabs-nav button:hover{color:#1A1612}\n.tap-tabs-nav button.on{color:#1A1612;border-color:#9A7B3A}\n.tap-tab-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:48px}\n.tap-tab-grid h3{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:28px;color:#1A1612;margin:0 0 14px}\n.tap-tab-grid p{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#3a342c;margin:0 0 14px}\n.tap-spec-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #E8DFC8;overflow:hidden}\n.tap-spec-list li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0e6d0;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#1A1612}\n.tap-spec-list li:last-child{border:0}\n.tap-spec-list span{color:#8b7f6a;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}\n@media(max-width:768px){.tap-tab-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n</style>"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
